{"id":"n40526-1-6","stage":2,"title":"다물다 · 闭（嘴）","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40526-1-6-1","ko":"야. 저 여자 진짜 예쁘지 않냐? 와!","zh":"喂，那个女生真的好漂亮吧？哇！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야.","meaning":"喂","explanation":"야：喂。","readings":[{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58149","senseId":"2","lemma":"야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的。","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘지","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘지","audio":"/audio/c20c58dac1a5b9541911.mp3"}},{"text":"않냐?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않냐","audio":"/audio/7da52d164afde25d55a6.mp3"}},{"text":"와!","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦。","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08945f015d460ad9","term":"야","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3","entryId":"58149","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["야ː"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]}],"audio":"/audio/b9a95d9e394c6b73011f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40526-1-6-2","ko":"입 좀 다물어라. 침 흘리겠다.","zh":"闭上嘴吧，都要流口水了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"입","meaning":"嘴，口","explanation":"입：嘴，口。","readings":[{"term":"입","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62276","senseId":"1","lemma":"입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"다물어라.","meaning":"闭（嘴）","explanation":"다물다：闭（嘴）；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"다물다","audio":"/audio/061bdd3ef78a0bbede2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40526","senseId":"1","lemma":"다물다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다물어라","audio":"/audio/6bfc8b618354fc4f986b.mp3"}},{"text":"침","meaning":"唾液，口涎，口沫","explanation":"침：唾液，口涎，口沫。","readings":[{"term":"침","audio":"/audio/5eddad890d2bed15923e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28133","senseId":"1","lemma":"침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"침","audio":"/audio/5eddad890d2bed15923e.mp3"}},{"text":"흘리겠다.","meaning":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，流淌，淌出来；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"5","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘리겠다","audio":"/audio/702a0312c56d3b2d3195.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c503f60b315f818e","term":"입","zh":"嘴，口","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3","entryId":"62276","definition":"吃食物、发音的器官，指从嘴唇到喉咙的部分。","pronunciation":["입"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"061bdd3ef78a0bbe","term":"다물다","zh":"闭（嘴）","audio":"/audio/061bdd3ef78a0bbede2f.mp3","entryId":"40526","definition":"上下嘴唇贴在一起，合上嘴。","pronunciation":["다물다"]},{"id":"5eddad890d2bed15","term":"침","zh":"唾液，口涎，口沫","audio":"/audio/5eddad890d2bed15923e.mp3","entryId":"28133","definition":"为防止口干舌燥而在口腔内生成的有助于消化的水。","pronunciation":["침"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"汗液、眼泪、鼻涕、血、口水等液体从体内排出。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/777dd2ad00b2332227e6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.485,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40526","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["喂，那个女生真的好漂亮吧？哇！","闭上嘴吧，都要流口水了。","爷爷，您上网的本事比我还要强啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["喂，那个女生真的好漂亮吧？哇！","闭上嘴吧，都要流口水了。","爷爷，您上网的本事比我还要强啊？"],"answer":1}]}
